      "content": "everything just... vanished. like i was never even here. the people i thought were my world just stopped existing for me, and now i'm just a ghost stuck in a body that won't stop moving. it feels like the \"me\" part is already deleted, and this physical thing i'm dragging around is just a glitch... like a leftover error in the system that shouldn't be running anymore. it's just so heavy and pointless.",
